<title>USA: Fed adds reserves through overnight system RPs.</title>
<headline>Fed adds reserves through overnight system RPs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve injected reserves to the banking system via overnight system repurchase agreements on Tuesday, the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>The operation was generally expected.</p>
<p>Fed funds were trading at 5-13/16 percent, above the 5-1/2 percent target, at the time of the intervention.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867 ))</p>
